    "created_at": "2017-09-11T11:13:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-11T11:13:49Z",
    "body": "> Inheriting the encoding seems about as problematic as the attribute, correct?\r\n\r\nYeah, we'd need to restrict both. What we do elsewhere is treat UTF-16/replacement as UTF-8. Not sure if that's appropriate for decoding though, but seems reasonable.",
