    "updated_at": "2017-09-11T11:38:47Z",
    "body": "Yeah, and it also compatible with a possible future in which we make more labels be treated as utf-8 or just force utf-8 for all external scripts.\r\n\r\nCSS `@charset \"utf-16\";` (as ASCII-compatible bytes) also switches to utf-8.\r\nhttps://drafts.csswg.org/css-syntax/#determine-the-fallback-encoding",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
